sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Clinician
    participant UI as Next.js Web Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI REST Gateway
    participant Gate as Defensive Quality Gate
    participant Model as PyTorch Inference Engine
    participant XAI as Grad-CAM Saliency Engine

    Clinician->>UI: Selects modality and uploads medical scan
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/predict/{modality} (multipart/form-data)
    activate API
    API->>Gate: validate_image(image_bytes)
    activate Gate
    alt Image fails quality checks (dimensions, blur, solid frame)
        Gate-->>API: ValidationError (e.g., standard deviation < 5.0)
        API-->>UI: HTTP 400 Bad Request (Detailed Clinical Reason)
        UI-->>Clinician: Display quality rejection alert & prompt re-upload
    else Image passes all quality checks
        Gate-->>API: Validated PIL Image
        deactivate Gate
        API->>Model: predict(standardized_tensor)
        activate Model
        Model->>Model: Forward pass through DenseNet-121 / EfficientNet-B0
        Model-->>API: Class probability & calibrated binary triage label
        API->>XAI: generate_explanation(model, layer, target_class)
        activate XAI
        XAI->>XAI: Backward pass, gradient pooling, ReLU, and JET colormap
        XAI-->>API: 224x224 RGB Heatmap Matrix & Saliency Metadata
        deactivate XAI
        deactivate Model
        API-->>UI: HTTP 200 OK (JSON payload: prediction, explanation, disclaimer)
        deactivate API
        UI->>UI: Render side-by-side view with interactive blend slider
        UI-->>Clinician: Display calibrated diagnostic result & visual explanation
    end